WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:03.667
-And finally, as I said,
this is our first show

00:00:03.667 --> 00:00:05.434
in over five months,
and so happy.

00:00:05.434 --> 00:00:08.701
Thank you.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.701 --> 00:00:10.868
So much has
happened in the news

00:00:10.868 --> 00:00:12.667
that we never got
the chance to talk about,

00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:15.534
so I thought it'd be good
to recap everything we've missed

00:00:15.534 --> 00:00:17.000
with a little song.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.801
♪ Let's catch up
on what we missed ♪

00:00:25.801 --> 00:00:28.033
♪ First things first,
there's Taylor Swift ♪

00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:31.167
♪ Wonder if she'll
write a song about meeting... ♪

00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:32.767
-Travis Kelce's mom.

00:00:32.767 --> 00:00:36.000
-♪ Politics and weird debates ♪

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.901
♪ All these random candidates ♪

00:00:37.901 --> 00:00:40.968
♪ Listening to them all summer,
we're like... ♪

00:00:40.968 --> 00:00:43.400
-Honestly, every time I hear
you, I feel a little bit dumber.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:45.367
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.367 --> 00:00:47.467
-♪ Twitter, well,
it's now called X ♪

00:00:47.467 --> 00:00:49.767
♪ And HBO is now called Max ♪

00:00:49.767 --> 00:00:51.868
♪ Everyone is so confused ♪

00:00:51.868 --> 00:00:53.968
♪ They all look
just like this dude ♪

00:00:58.767 --> 00:01:01.000
♪ Grimace Shakes
and Munchkin Drinks ♪

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.167
♪ All these new foods
make you think ♪

00:01:03.167 --> 00:01:06.267
♪ Try them all, it'd be insane,
and give you... ♪

00:01:06.267 --> 00:01:07.934
-Diarrhea on the Delta plane.

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:09.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.367 --> 00:01:20.634
-♪ Burning Man,
it kind of sucked ♪

00:01:20.634 --> 00:01:22.767
♪ Thanks to mud,
they all got stuck ♪

00:01:22.767 --> 00:01:26.234
♪ That party was such a pain,
while the White House has... ♪

00:01:26.234 --> 00:01:27.601
-A bag of cocaine.

00:01:27.601 --> 00:01:29.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:31.200
-♪ "Barbie" movie,
an all-timer ♪

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:33.334
♪ Double feature,
"Oppenheimer" ♪

00:01:33.334 --> 00:01:36.534
♪ Other films were really
trying, but also asking... ♪

00:01:36.534 --> 00:01:38.467
-Do you guys ever think
about dying?

00:01:38.467 --> 00:01:41.567
-♪ Charles is the newest king ♪

00:01:41.567 --> 00:01:43.534
♪ Coronation was boring ♪

00:01:43.534 --> 00:01:45.701
♪ For a more exciting time,

00:01:45.701 --> 00:01:47.801
throw yourself
down this big slide ♪

00:01:51.234 --> 00:01:53.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.133 --> 00:01:55.534
-What?!

00:01:57.133 --> 00:01:59.400
-♪ UFOs from Mexico ♪

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:01.567
♪ Divorce for de Blasio ♪

00:02:01.567 --> 00:02:04.467
♪ A congresswoman
made the news when she... ♪

00:02:04.467 --> 00:02:06.434
-Got handsy at
a performance of "Beetlejuice."

00:02:06.434 --> 00:02:09.734
-♪ So much stuff
while we were gone ♪

00:02:09.734 --> 00:02:12.033
♪ Zuckerberg against Elon ♪

00:02:12.033 --> 00:02:13.734
♪ Biden's dog bit everyone ♪

00:02:13.734 --> 00:02:15.868
♪ And Colorado coach Deion ♪

00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:18.067
♪ And girl-dinner phenomenon ♪

00:02:18.067 --> 00:02:20.300
♪ And reborn Bed Bath &amp; Beyond ♪

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:22.367
♪ And final tour for
Elton John ♪

00:02:22.367 --> 00:02:24.434
♪ And Messi is Floridian ♪

00:02:24.434 --> 00:02:26.601
♪ And bye-bye to "Succession" ♪

00:02:26.601 --> 00:02:28.701
♪ And Seacrest hosts
"Wheel of Fortune" ♪

00:02:28.701 --> 00:02:30.801
♪ And Coco won U.S. Open ♪

00:02:30.801 --> 00:02:33.801
♪ And this show
is a brand-new one ♪

00:02:33.801 --> 00:02:36.534
♪ I've missed you all,
and that's the truth ♪

00:02:36.534 --> 00:02:38.701
♪ My great writers
and awesome crew ♪

00:02:38.701 --> 00:02:40.734
♪ I couldn't do this
without you ♪

00:02:40.734 --> 00:02:43.667
♪ Now give it up for The Roots ♪

00:02:43.667 --> 00:02:44.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

